node 6 Compositing Comment
  pos 0 722
  s text Gamelan Ombak Metallophone Synth. Struck bronze gamelan metallophone with paired ombak beating detune, inharmonic bar partials, mallet transient, and bamboo tube resonator.
  f width 340
  f height 120
end
note synth 0 notes
aud speakers 0 synth
cable out 0 pic